---
title: Supplier onboarding
---
%% Import with: flowyaml import examples/onboarding.mmd -o onboarding.yaml
flowchart TD
    start([Application received]) --> intake[Register the supplier file]
    intake --> complete{Documentation complete?}
    complete -->|No| chase[/Request the missing documents/]
    chase -.-> intake
    complete -->|Yes| review[[Compliance review]]
    review --> risk{{Risk tier}}
    risk -- low --> approve[Approve and publish to the catalogue]
    risk -- high --> board[Escalate to the procurement board]
    board --> approve
    approve --> ledger[(Supplier ledger)]
    ledger --> done((Onboarding closed))
